            "value": "在主机 Mac 上打开“设置”›“设备”›“配对其他设备”，然后将代码粘贴到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the host, open Yorozu › Settings › Devices › Pair Another Device, then paste its code here. A tapped yorozu:// link works too.": {
      "localizations": {
