    "OpenClaw": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClaw"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenClaw owns models, tools, browser access, credentials, and approvals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClaw posee modelos, herramientas, acceso al navegador, credenciales y aprobaciones."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClawは、モデル、ツール、ブラウザアクセス、認証情報、および承認を管理します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClaw가 모델, 도구, 브라우저 액세스, 자격 증명 및 승인 권한을 관리합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClaw 拥有模型、工具、浏览器访问权限、凭据及审批权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenClaw runs as its own process and asks macOS for its own permissions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClawは独立したプロセスで動作し、必要な権限をmacOSに個別に要求します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or paste it into Connect to another Mac on a Mac, or Enter code manually on an iPhone or iPad. Codes work once and expire; keep this one private.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Macの「別のMacに接続」、またはiPhoneやiPadの「コードを手動入力」に貼り付けることもできます。コードは1回限りで有効期限があります。他人に共有しないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other hosts stay connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "他のホストとの接続は維持されます。"
